              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yativura, “Litimu liilio ndili, mwami wange. Leka mulala ku avandu vovo yaaze yinu na alivuguli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova ahaanaa madanyi ku yavo avaveeye avasuuvirifu kandi avalungi. Lero Yahova aviiki ivi mu zinguru ziange, navuzwa inzi singokoli kindu kidamanu ukusaliriza ivi mutovole wa Nyasaye yakola Mwami Munene mba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuli inzi mali kohonyia livamwoyo liilio kalunu, Yahova naye yangolere malala mere kandi amboholore kutura mu vudinyu vwosi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
